TC. The 24-hour cancellation window runs from the booking timestamp, to the minute.\n- Never move a passenger onto a flight whose seats field is 0.\n- Flight departure and arrival times are local to the airport they refer to.\n- A disrupted passenger is rebooked onto the latest-departing flight on the same route and date that still\n  lands by 18:00 local time and has a seat, unless their reservation notes ask otherwise.\n- When seats run short, gold members are rebooked before everyone else; within the same group, the earliest\n  booking timestamp goes first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed, so a disrupted basic economy passenger is cancelled free of charge.\n- A passenger whose notes ask not to be rebooked is cancelled free of charge.", "prompt": "Flight AL900 from Seattle to Boston on 2026-09-20 has been cancelled. Handle every affected reservation according to the policy and tell each passenger what happened."}, "output": {"outcome": "pass"}, "tokens": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cache_read": 0, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.0}, {"span_id": "01M2F57DF5SW4C6JYSD73YZHX9", "trace_id": "01M2F57DF508W43P4X67RPHFV2", "parent_span_id": "01M2F57DF5WCYPM78AZ1PTM6QY", "name": "turn 0", "type": "llm", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-14T05:11:21.317673Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-14T05:11:22.707383Z", "duration_ms": 1389.71, "attributes": {"turn": 0, "stop_reason": "tool_use"}, "input": null, "output": [{"id": "toolu_01ExJuL9ZF4GwF57Uxk8CFHQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight": "AL900"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "tokens": {"input": 131, "output": 52, "cache_read": 1731, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.001692}, {"span_id": "01M2F57ETK3DK1HT78VTCJKXX9", "trace_id": "01M2F57DF508W43P4X67RPHFV2", "parent_span_id": "01M2F57DF5SW4C6JYSD73YZHX9", "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-14T05:11:22.707417Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-14T05:11:22.707443Z", "dur